                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Heroes Of Delum is a short, super replayable & fun strategic tower defence type game, but fast-paced with plenty of action going on. It reminds me of Runescape cross age of empires style wise the tower defence aspect mixed with running around collecting resources and having combat is pretty fun. The first match I had was about 30 minutes long and it was pretty fun. Lots of creativity into the monsters too! \n\nFor the price, it's a fun game to pick up and especially fun to play with friends! Would recommend!",
